WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.364
Weak MTW gives convexity.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.539
From a point, mark every direction whose geodesic still minimizes. Villani asked:

3
00:00:07.689 --> 00:00:11.028
is that region always convex, even with conjugate cut points?

4
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.090
Claimed: yes, and optimal transport maps are Hölder both ways.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.584
Both main theorems checked in Lean.
